{
  "Title": "ELSA-2026-72623:  kernel security, bug fix, and enhancement update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "[5.14.0-687.53.1]\n- Disable UKI signing [Orabug: 36571828]\n- Update Oracle Linux certificates (Kevin Lyons)\n- Disable signing for aarch64 (Ilya Okomin)\n- Oracle Linux RHCK Module Signing Key was added to the kernel trusted keys list (olkmod_signing_key.pem) [Orabug: 29539237]\n- Update x509.genkey [Orabug: 24817676]\n- Conflict with shim-ia32 and shim-x64 \u003c= 15.3-1.0.5]\n- Remove upstream reference during boot (Kevin Lyons) [Orabug: 34729535]\n- Add Oracle Linux IMA certificates\n- Add new Oracle Linux Driver Signing (key 1) certificate [Orabug: 37985764]\n\n[5.14.0-687.53.1]\n- arm64: tlb: Flush walk cache when unsharing PMD tables (Rafael Aquini) [RHEL-259312] {CVE-2026-63875}\n- perf: Reject exited events as group leaders (Anubhav Shelat) [RHEL-258817] {CVE-2026-74753}\n- perf/core: Detach event groups during remove_on_exec (Anubhav Shelat) [RHEL-250504] {CVE-2026-64556}\n- ext4: fix e4b bitmap inconsistency reports (Lukas Herbolt) [RHEL-225944] {CVE-2026-45942}\n- crypto: af_alg - Cap AEAD AD length to 0x80000000 (CKI Backport Bot) [RHEL-259061] {CVE-2026-52972}\n- fhandle: fix UAF due to unlocked -\u003emnt_ns read in may_decode_fh() (Abhi Das) [RHEL-231391] {CVE-2026-53341}\n- crypto: testmgr - block Crypto API xxhash64 in FIPS mode (Vladislav Dronov) [RHEL-256437]\n- crypto: tegra - fix rctx-\u003ecryptlen calculation in tegra_gcm_do_one_req() (CKI Backport Bot) [RHEL-254308] {CVE-2026-80522}\n- RDMA/rxe: Fix iova-to-va conversion for MR page sizes != PAGE_SIZE (Kamal Heib) [RHEL-230788] {CVE-2026-46325}\n- RDMA/rxe: Remove unused page_offset member (Kamal Heib) [RHEL-230788]\n- RDMA/rxe: Remove redundant assignment to variable page_offset (Kamal Heib) [RHEL-230788]\n- Revert 'RDMA/rxe: RHEL-only revert for page size vars in rxe' (Kamal Heib) [RHEL-230788]\n- KVM: s390: selftests: Add IRQ routing address offset tests (Christoph Schlameuss) [RHEL-188656]\n- KVM: s390: Limit adapter indicator access to mapped page (Christoph Schlameuss) [RHEL-188656]\n- RDMA/siw: Reject MPA FPDU length underflow before signed receive math (CKI Backport Bot) [RHEL-232566] {CVE-2026-64102}\n- rxrpc: Fix rxrpc_input_call_event() to only unshare DATA packets (Marc Dionne) [RHEL-179563]\n- rxrpc: Fix potential UAF after skb_unshare() failure (Marc Dionne) [RHEL-179563] {CVE-2026-45998}",
